      "observed_at": "2026-11-20",
      "note": "dev integrates the two prepared patches and their tests: UDP NAT entries cancel the dial they launched on every close path (idle sweep, explicit Close, capacity eviction); the Linux netlink monitor reopens its subscription with 1s->30s backoff after a read error and emits one update after recovery. The follow-up commit closes the install-after-Close window: setSocket refuses under the same lock Close uses and closes the socket it opened, and a controlled test pauses recovery before the install and runs Close in that window (red before the fix, 3.5s; green after, 3.0s). The pin was moved by release-freeze.py apply and needs a run at the new lock before the release gate is satisfied."
    },
